<name>OCT P-1616 - Lot 4 Psu-143364 (APPROXIMATE v3)</name>
<description>Allan V. Inocalla - 152,069 sqm - Brgy. San Rafael, Jose Panganiban, Camarines Norte.
SHAPE exact (title technical description; closure 0.07 m). POSITION v3 (2026-09-02, +/- ~0.8 km):
constraint-solved - the parcel must lie wholly inside the official Brgy. San Rafael boundary
(NAMRIA/PSGC 2023 polygon) while its tie line (3,508.83 m at S60E back from corner 1) must land
inside Brgy. Batobalani (BLBM No.1's barangay). Feasible corner-1 zone: 14.240-14.254 N,
122.685-122.701 E; centroid used here. Corroborated by the APSA-000322-V claims cluster
(graticule read ~14.255, 122.702) at the zone's NE edge. Supersedes v2 (which assumed BLBM at
the modern barangay center - shown wrong by ~3 km; implied true BLBM zone is western Batobalani
near the Batobalane River). NOT for boundary decisions. Exact fix: BLBM No.1 coordinates + tie
minutes (DENR R-V SMD + PENRO CamNorte requests sent 2026-09-01), or GPS pins on monumented
corners 8-11.</description>
